<TMPDIR>/cursor-plan-edge-output.txt:27:5. **[correctness]** [plan.txt](plan.txt) `design-log-publish.sh` copy rules — “non-recursive depth-1 for files; recurse one level into `render-cache/`” drops any other subdirectory trees under `DESIGN_TMPDIR` without surfacing an error, which is silent log loss if future steps stash artifacts in nested folders. **Suggested revision:** recurse with explicit include/exclude rules aligned with how design artifacts are laid out, or fail closed when unexpected directories exist.
