<TMPDIR>/codex-primary-plan-requirements-output.txt.sidecar:3148:./larch-logs/implement/5F7568AE-E8DA-4B76-8E08-E03C1DA604FC/round-2/findings.md:93:- **Concern**: [important] Part B (pre-merge write-final-report before larch-log commit) not implemented; Step 7a text forbids write-final-report until ship-pr-state exists. Feature/plan require write-final-report before merge sentinel so final-summary can be committed pre-sentinel; branch defers to Step 17/18, so successful-merge runs can still miss committed final-summary when post-merge sentinel blocks larch-log commit. Implement planned Step 7a write-final-report (with documented provisional PR_URL / missing merge SHA) or add another commit path before sentinel; align SKILL.md with agreed spec.
<TMPDIR>/codex-primary-plan-requirements-output.txt.sidecar:3149:./larch-logs/implement/5F7568AE-E8DA-4B76-8E08-E03C1DA604FC/round-2/findings.md:98:- **Concern**: [important] Part B of the plan is not implemented; Step 7a explicitly avoids write-final-report and defers to Step 17/18. Successful merges still hit post-merge-sentinel before terminal final-summary writes, so larch-log commits for final-summary can remain suppressed—the original regression the plan aimed to fix persists. Implement the planned pre-bump write-final-report (before larch-log commit) or adjust sentinel/larch-log rules and update the plan accordingly.
