<TMPDIR>/codex-primary-plan-requirements-output.txt.sidecar:3165:./larch-logs/implement/88402D4F-E2FA-4302-96C1-5CBEA84D64ED/execution-issues.ndjson:14:{"phase":"implement","step":"7a","category":"Out-of-Scope Observations","source":"execution-issues.md pre-bump","source_sha256":"2335d5be69929d03238d2be4eebc491ad8c86b1776aa7c1b540e463d592a02cf","body":"\nNone worth listing; remaining deltas (e.g., exit `1` on failed verification vs plan prose that only showed `larch_err`) align with the feature’s “verify” intent and with the updated [`skills/upgrade-larch/scripts/upgrade-larch.md`](skills/upgrade-larch/scripts/upgrade-larch.md) contract.\n\n---\n\n**Commits** (`git merge-base HEAD main`..HEAD): `2c73066` Add stable-release…, `d2b0155` / `7461459` / `e264795` Address code review feedback (rounds 1–3), `b09b04e` / `12fbb39` / `1eb2deb` chore(larch-logs): flush implement run…\n\n---\n\n**TSV (not written to disk — copy if you need a sidecar file)**\n\n```text\nschema_version\tscope\tseverity\tfocus_area\tlocation\twhat\tscenario_or_breakage\tsuggested_fix\n1\tin_scope\timportant\tcorrectness\tskills/upgrade-larch/scripts/upgrade-larch.sh:170-219\tPrune only runs when VERIFIED_TARGET; no prune when LATEST_STABLE empty\tImplementation plan edge case: without gh pruning should still run after successful upgrade; caches never pruned for gh-less installs\tAdd unconditional post-success prune when LATEST_STABLE empty or revise plan contract\n1\tin_scope\timportant\tarchitecture\tlarch-logs/implement/88402D4F-E2FA-4302-96C1-5CBEA84D64ED/\tNew implement run log and tally files not in plan file list\tShipping diff includes session artifacts outside planned three-file deliverable\tRemove from branch unless run-log policy requires\n1\tin_scope\tnit\tarchitecture\tskills/upgrade-larch/SKILL.md:1-58\tSKILL.md changed but omitted from plan Files to modify\tMinor plan checklist vs actual diff mismatch\tExtend plan file list or document edit-in-sync rule for SKILL\n```\n  ```\n"}
