skills/review/scripts/emit-tally.md:5:It writes `review-round-summary.md`, `review-summary.json` with `schema_version=2`, and `rejected-findings.md`. Accepted and rejected totals come from the summary counters in `review-tally.env`, and the compact rejected listing includes only `FINDING_*_OUTCOME=rejected` entries (not neutral or exonerated findings). The JSON summary includes `panel.scout_status`, `panel.static_slot_count`, `panel.dynamic_slot_count`, and `panel.total_slot_count`, populated by `--scout-status`, `--static-slot-count`, and `--dynamic-slots` (defaulting to `na`/`0`/`0`). It also invokes `skills/shared/scripts/oos-serialize.sh` for accepted OOS serialization and copies summary files to parent tmpdirs when `--session-env-path` or `--implement-tmpdir` is provided.
